    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25650" root="ضد" body-key="D">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اضدّ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, S) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, angry.</i>
(S, K.) It is not, as some assert it to be, a
quasi-pass. [of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَدَّهُ</span>], like as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكَبَّ</span> is of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَبَّهُ</span>.
(TA.)

